"Auto for {#0} GB: whole context, VAE tiles {#1}; the backbone and keeping models loaded stay your choice. Press Save to apply.": "Automático para {#0} GB: todo el contexto, mosaicos VAE {#1}; la base y mantener los modelos cargados siguen siendo tu elección. Pulsa «Guardar» para aplicar.",
"Human, artwork for {0} takes in one volley? Won't your graphics card waste away?": "Humano, ¿portadas para {0} tomas de una sola ráfaga? ¿No se te consumirá la tarjeta gráfica?",
"Human, {0} whole songs made again in one volley? Won't your graphics card waste away?": "Humano, ¿{0} canciones enteras rehechas de una sola ráfaga? ¿No se te consumirá la tarjeta gráfica?",
"{#0} of them have artwork already: drawing for the {#1} without leaves those as they are; redrawing all keeps each old picture beside its take.": "{#0} de ellas ya tienen portada: pintar las {#1} sin ella deja aquellas como están; redibujar todas guarda cada imagen vieja junto a su toma.",
"All of them have artwork already: each old picture is kept beside its take.": "Todas tienen ya portada: cada imagen vieja se guarda junto a su toma.",
"Drawing artwork for {#0} takes, one after another: about {#1} minutes": "Pintando portadas para {#0} tomas, una tras otra: unos {#1} minutos",
"Artwork drawn: {#0} of {#1}": "Portadas pintadas: {#0} de {#1}",
"Take the artwork off “{0}”?": "¿Quitar la portada de «{0}»?",
"It is kept beside the take, in artwork-removed/, and the take's MP3s lose it as their cover; the take's menu can paint a new one.": "Se guarda junto a la toma, en artwork-removed/, y los MP3 de la toma la pierden como portada; el menú de la toma puede pintar una nueva.",
"Take the artwork off {#0} takes?": { "one": "¿Quitar la portada de {#0} toma?", "other": "¿Quitar la portada de {#0} tomas?" },
"Each picture is kept beside its take, in artwork-removed/, and their MP3s lose it as their cover; the menu can paint new ones.": "Cada imagen se guarda junto a su toma, en artwork-removed/, y sus MP3 la pierden como portada; el menú puede pintar otras nuevas.",
"The artwork is off {#0} takes: kept beside each, in artwork-removed/": "Las portadas se quitaron de {#0} tomas: guardadas junto a cada una, en artwork-removed/",
"Each is made again from its own request with new seeds, the score and the music anew: minutes on a GPU each, {0} of music in all. They queue one after another; the old ones are kept in “Sourced for Regeneration”.": "Cada una se rehace desde su propia petición con semillas nuevas, la partitura y la música de nuevo: minutos en una GPU cada una, {0} de música en total. Hacen cola una tras otra; las viejas se guardan en «Sourced for Regeneration».",
"End the take at a moment": "Terminar la toma en un momento",
"{0} ends at which moment (m:ss)? Its last {#1} s fade out, and nothing after it is kept. A new take; this one stays.": "¿En qué momento termina {0} (m:ss)? Sus últimos {#1} s se apagan, y nada después se conserva. Una toma nueva; esta se queda.",
"Ending {0} at {1}…": "Terminando {0} en {1}…",
