"From the bar at {0} (where the player stands), how many bars: 1, 2, 4 or 8? Seamless, its end running into its start; saved as a WAV.": "Desde el compás en {0} (donde está el reproductor), ¿cuántos compases: 1, 2, 4 u 8? Sin costuras, su final corre hacia su inicio; se guarda como WAV.",
"The loop: {0}": "El bucle: {0}",
"1 bar, {#0} s at {#1} BPM, {2}": "1 compás, {#0} s a {#1} BPM, {2}",
