"The shift glides from point to point; a note takes it at its start, in whole semitones": "El desplazamiento se desliza de punto a punto; una nota lo toma en su inicio, en semitonos enteros",
"As it is": "Tal cual",
"To minor": "A menor",
"A major part in its minor: the third, the sixth and the seventh a semitone down, the chords with them": "Una parte mayor a su menor: la tercera, la sexta y la séptima un semitono abajo, con sus acordes",
"To major": "A mayor",
"A minor part in its major: the third, the sixth and the seventh a semitone up, the chords with them": "Una parte menor a su mayor: la tercera, la sexta y la séptima un semitono arriba, con sus acordes",
