"The share of the steps where MAIN CONTROL's envelope reaches its end strength (his: 100 %)": "La parte de los pasos en la que la envolvente de MAIN CONTROL llega a su fuerza final (la suya: 100 %)",
"How MAIN CONTROL's strength goes from start to end: linear, ease_in (slow at first), ease_out (slow at the end) or ease_in_out (slow at both ends) (his: ease_in)": "Cómo va la fuerza de MAIN CONTROL del inicio al final: linear, ease_in (lenta al principio), ease_out (lenta al final) o ease_in_out (lenta en ambos extremos) (la suya: ease_in)",
